# DigitalGuardian area 53 (world 1baa96c2, 09_cliff_temple_dark): the head's ChargeAttack
# (fn_14_16A50), its three cutting lasers (fn_14_FB70 / FE14 / F6A4 / FAEC) and the head's
# projectile event (fn_14_17BBC). The player morphs; the head (e0035000f) is put in the state.
# One laser is deleted by id (the run's own ids, u063f..u0641, printed at f225), so F6A4 meets a
# missing laser; a large dt ends the sweep (the lasers but the first go), first without and then
# with the boost shield (flag 0x01); msg 3 (no arm); back-to-back statecalls start a sweep on the
# old animation; six fresh sweeps (400 frames: the projectile event comes late), the first left
# mid-animation (the abort); XDEL deletes the head (FAEC via AcceptScriptMsg).
# The morph press is timing-sensitive: check `status` at f190 says morph 1.
# Run: tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/digitalguardian_states.py <out> 1baa96c2,09_cliff_temple_dark
#   --con tools/cov/specs/digitalguardian_charge.con --fast --frames 2900
@f30 layer 3
@f60 layer 11; god 1; give morphBall; give boostBall
@f150 send e00350060 Activate; send e0035000f Activate
@f160 fastmorph 1; press x 30
@f190 status
@f200 place e0035000f player 20; fsm e0035000f ChargeAttack
@f225 objs Plasma; status
@f230 send u0641 Delete
@f234 statecall e0035000f ChargeAttack 1 0.016; objs Plasma
# the sweep's end (dt 30): the lasers but the first go; morphed, no boost shield yet
@f237 statecall e0035000f ChargeAttack 1 30; objs Plasma
@f250 boost
@f260 statecall e0035000f ChargeAttack 1 0.016; statecall e0035000f ChargeAttack 3; objs Plasma
@f320 objs Plasma; obj e0035000f
# a sweep started on the old animation (no projectile event: its time left, fn_14_FB70 0xFC34)
@f340 statecall e0035000f ChargeAttack 2; statecall e0035000f ChargeAttack 0; statecall e0035000f ChargeAttack 1; statecall e0035000f ChargeAttack 1 0.016
# unmorph; fresh sweeps after fresh picks (the projectile event's arms by 0x10D0); the first is
# left mid-animation (the abort at 0x16CE0)
@f335 press x 30
@f360 fsm e0035000f FaceTarget
@f362 codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack; fsm e0035000f ChargeAttack
@f380 fsm e0035000f FaceTarget; obj e0035000f
@f400 fsm e0035000f FaceTarget
@f430 codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack; fsm e0035000f ChargeAttack
@f790 obj e0035000f; objs Plasma
@f800 fsm e0035000f FaceTarget
@f830 codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack; codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack; fsm e0035000f ChargeAttack
@f1190 obj e0035000f; objs Plasma
@f1200 fsm e0035000f FaceTarget
@f1230 codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack; codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack; codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack; fsm e0035000f ChargeAttack
@f1590 obj e0035000f; objs Plasma
@f1600 fsm e0035000f FaceTarget
@f1630 codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack; fsm e0035000f ChargeAttack
@f1990 obj e0035000f; objs Plasma
@f2000 fsm e0035000f FaceTarget
@f2030 codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack; codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack; fsm e0035000f ChargeAttack
@f2390 obj e0035000f; objs Plasma
@f2400 fsm e0035000f FaceTarget
@f2430 codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack; codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack; codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack; fsm e0035000f ChargeAttack
@f2790 obj e0035000f; objs Plasma
@f2800 send e0035000f Delete
@f2840 objs Plasma
